All five modules are complete and consistent with each other: `models.py` defines the four dataclasses with `to_dict`/`from_dict`; `storage.py` implements `JsonStore` with the exact on-disk format, atomic saves, and KeyError on unknown sku/location; `rules.py` enforces qty>0, uniqueness of `ref` (checked before any mutation), stock and capacity rules (capacity summed across all skus at a location), appends exactly one movement per successful call, and provides `total_on_hand`, `below_reorder`, `valuation`, and `ledger`; `cli.py` exposes the five subcommands over `--db` with one JSON line per result; and `tests.py` contains 24 unittest tests (storage format/behavior, every rule including negative-path state-unchanged checks, reports/ledger, persistence shape, and CLI subprocess tests) runnable via `python -m unittest tests`.
